    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d563">

                <pb facs="0797" n="785" sameAs="frus:frus1945v06/pg785"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 Control(Japan)/10–2545: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Harriman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-10-25T18:00:00+03:00">October 25, 1945—6
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received October 25—12:50 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3659. [For Secretary No. 1.] Had 3-hour frank friendly talk alone with
                    Stalin.</p>
                <p>He stated control Japan is first question requiring settlement. Any new
                    information on our policy would be helpful.</p>
                <pb facs="0798" n="786" xml:id="pg786"/>
                <p>Re procedure at London it is now clear Molotov was acting entirely under
                    instructions. Made some progress though still inconclusive. Meeting again
                    tomorrow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Harriman</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
